        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "In the event, the office objections are complied with, list this matter before the Court at the appropriate stage without a memo.\"\nEven today, the learned counsel for petitioners has not complied with the office objections.\nTherefore, the petition is dismissed for its non-prosecution.\nSd/-\n(M.NAGAPRASANNA) JUDGE KG Sri. Hitesh Shetty vs The State Of Karnataka By on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/157061373/\n3",
